Fre3nderScreen source: https://github.com/ElHanko/fre3nderscreen.git
The imported payload/artifact-manifest.json records the resolved source
release, commit, submodule commits, and Fre3nder build identity.

Fre3nderScreen is derived from Guppy Screen. Its source history and copyright
notices remain in the source. COPYING is Fre3nderScreen's GPL version 3
text. The build applies Fre3nderScreen's source-owned submodule patches.
LVGL, lv_drivers, and spdlog are MIT licensed; libhv and the inherited
wpa_supplicant control client are BSD-3-Clause licensed. Their license texts
are imported byte-for-byte from the qualified Fre3nder artifact into
payload/licenses/. These licenses permit redistribution with their notices.

The compiled DejaVu Sans Mono asset was inherited from Guppy Screen; the
original font version and TTF cannot be reconstructed from this source tree.
The imported DEJAVU-FONTS-LICENSE preserves the applicable Bitstream Vera
derived terms.
The inherited Material Design Icons assets are credited to Pictogrammers in
the Fre3nderScreen source; the imported MATERIAL-DESIGN-ICONS-LICENSE is
Apache-2.0.
